description:
게임 정보
Explore a world filled with unique challenges and obstacles! 💚 In Goo Hunter 💚, you play as a brave Slime treasure hunter who uses her unique abilities to overcome dangerous obstacles and solve intriguing puzzles. With her sticky hands, she skillfully launches herself, uncovering the best path to progress in her adventure.
🧩 Key Features:
Challenging puzzles that test your strategy and precision;
50 handcrafted levels with meticulous attention to detail;

게임 정보
Have you ever dreamed in being a small slime exploring and adventuring through a magical world? Well, your time has come! 
Adventurous Slime is a mini metroidvania about a small but very courageous slime going on an adventure. Featuring a magical world full of dangerous creatures and powerful ancient items to find, colorful pixelated visuals and chiptune songs.
Somebody freed Lord Old Skull and now the little witches are afraid and need a very powerful hero to protect the world! But our slimes don't know any big hero, so they decide to go stop this evil creature by themselves! Why? Well, because they are adventurous slimes!
To finish and/or complete this game it'll probably take around 2/3 hours in most cases, but if you are an experienced metroidvania player, it's possible to finish it in around 1 hour. Also using a controller is highly recommended to playing this game. 
FEATURES
Visit 4 different biomes;
4 bosses to face;
3 Difficulty levels (can be changed at any time);
Customize your slime;
Colorful 8-bit style graphics;
Vibrant Chiptune style music;
Many different Items to collect;
Simplified experience level system;
Alternative paths.

게임 정보
They say that if you want something immensely, it will definitely come true. Those who wish to realize their dream receive a supernatural ability — the way to its fulfillment! A high school student, Tyler discovers such a power in himself: the talent to control the flame, which henceforth serves as his second heart. Meanwhile, it turns out that his friend Jean also has an unusual gift: he can command time. But who are these mysterious ghosts that roam around? Are these persecutions somehow connected with the boys' magic?

Visual novel, adventure, slice of life, fantasy, romance, shounen-ai, comedy, drama, school.

• colorful illustrations;
• romantic scenes;
• original soundtrack;
• dark atmosphere and mysterious plot.

게임 정보
Track Racing: The Holy Rosary is a Catholic game where you race in tracks along the game and play Gervásio (First person) and find the joy of what is being to God (Story Mode). Try to do your best time in Time Attack Mode. Race against other racers in Race mode. And you can race against other players in the World with your friends.
Some Features:
-Drive in First Person (Story Mode);
-Time Attack (3rd Person);
-Quick Race Mode (3rd Person);
-Multiplayer Mode (3rd Person);
Coming 2025 :)

게임 정보
Dangerous Galaxy is a rogue-lite with physics-based combat and extensive ship upgrading, where you explore procedurally generated star systems, manage resources, and fight enemies and boss battles to save the galaxy from evil. 
Extensive ship upgrading system:
Different main weapons that you can choose before each run;
Freedom to add or stack upgrades however you want;
Upgrade leveling - Each active upgrade has an upgrade path that you can choose;
Active abilities - The player can hold 4 active abilities at any time.
Fun physics-based combat:
Every object (including the player) can be pushed away, bumped into or destroyed;
Active abilities (like rockets) can create explosions or gravity-altering effects.

게임 정보
The Derailed - a first-person psychological horror game in the "walking simulator" genre.
Average playtime: 60 minutes
Raindrops crash against the leaky roof, with a damp scent lingering in the air. Decades-worn walls, rattling window panes in the wind, and the hollow echo of footsteps — all around, the setting seems to repeatedly warn you that you don’t belong here. But there is no other choice; the only path is forward.
Game Features:
"Walking simulator" genre;
Interact with objects and solve puzzles to progress through the story;
Discover the secret hidden within an almost-forgotten depot;
Immerse yourself in a haunting environment with detailed locations;
Rich 3D sound that fully envelops you in the atmosphere;
Short playtime, allowing you to complete the game in one evening and maintain suspense until the very end.
email: deformeddreams@gmail.com

