게임 정보
1) 이것은 조작이 간단하고, 사격이 쾌적하며, 전투가 격렬한 비행 사격 게임입니다;
2) 30개의 줄거리 장절,"뚱뚱한 새"(가제, 캐릭터가 조종하는 슈퍼 헬리콥터) 와 평행세계에서 온"우리"의 전쟁 이야기를 다루며, 약 20여 시간의 줄거리 모드 체험 시간이 길다;
3) 30개의 지형이 각기 다른 3d장면에서 강력한 화력을 통해 적과 방어, 공격, 호송, 수색, 사냥, 보호, 쟁탈, 구출, 추격, 저격 등 10여 가지 유형의 임무를 수행하는 전투;
4) 2가지 게임 모드 선택 가능, 줄거리 모드, 방어 모드, 적은 모두 대량의 무작위 진입 방식을 채택하여 매번 통관마다 도전을 가지게 한다;
5) 30여종의 부동한 류형의 차량, 비행기, 군함함, 10여종의 부동한 류형의 화력탑.게임의 플레이를 재미있고 풍부하게 만드는 10 가지 이상의 기지;
6) 플레이어는 3 가지 다른 유형의 무기, 5 가지 다른 유형의 화력 지원, 1 대의 화력이 강한 요기, 1 개의 이동 가능한 지상 기동 부대가 플레이어에게 강력한 화력 출력을 제공합니다;
7) 강력한 화력 출력, 화력 지원으로 인한 시원시원한 화력 제압으로 전투에서의 즐거움을 만끽;
8) 12개의 방어 퀘스트, 무료 업데이트 지속.

게임 정보
In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends–Angela, Junior, and Lucia–have their return to school interrupted by a Delusion.
Delusion occurs when a place becomes corrupted by an energy called SIN, turning animals hostile and distorting reality based on traumas and nightmares. To survive the Disillusion, Arthur and his friends rely on the power of Hope, an energy known as FAITH, and their imagination.
With a linear gameplay flow focused on dialogue and exploration, you must solve puzzles and face enemies in turn-based combat within the corrupted school. The more enemies you fight, the stronger you become by accumulating FAITH.
This game is inspired by horror games made in RPG Maker and adapted into a 3D perspective, with strong influences from retro PSX-style graphics.
Features:
- A sinister and distorted atmosphere;
- 4 playable characters, each with unique stories and mechanics;
- Turn-based combat featuring unique SIN and FAITH systems;
- Nostalgic visuals with original, hand-painted digital textures;
- An original and distorted soundtrack.

게임 정보
Story
One day King Froggold II brought some old toys from the late King Froggold the First to the Fairy Kingdom as a gift for the young Prince Leonid the Second. It doesn't look like the prince appreciated the gift, but that's not really the story.
After buying a new apartment, you urgently needed a good job, and you managed to get a job with the richest man in Prague. His royal garden is often raided by some vandals. You will have to work as a night guard of the royal garden and make sure that no vandals sneak into the garden. The instructions will be explained to you by King Froggold the Second's chief servant.
Features of the game
Story campaign - protect the royal garden, chase away vandals, be present in the current events of the Fairy Kingdom;
Unusual workplace - who would have thought that you would be sitting in a hut on chicken legs, and not in a normal office;
Dialogues - communicate with the main servant and your mentor Lorenzi, with your colleague Daniel and even with His Majesty King Froggold the Second;
Video surveillance - inspect the garden, use night vision, activate the alarm if necessary;
Mobile phone - receive messages, use the camera;
Endless mode - live as long as possible;
Secret nights with its own special features;
Bestiary - learn details about the characters and the methods of defending against antagonists;
Mini-game - defend against an endless stream of toys;
Gallery with beautiful art from loyal fans.

