게임 정보
Many Things Can Change After A Trauma.

For Nathan, the way he saw the world was affected after being shot in a robbery. When he acquires a new skill, he finds himself immersed in a sucession of events that, one by one, shakes the pillars of his already fragile life.
Technical Facts
Multiple endings: your choices matter;
About 5 hours of gameplay;
15+ backgrounds and 15+ CGs;
20+ original songs.

게임 정보
Quadrofriend - is a horror story in the walking simulator genre. The game features puzzles, Easter eggs, item searching, a quest system, references to movies and games, enemies you need to run away from, a well-developed story in the form of notes, dialogues between the protagonist and the antagonist.
Quadrofriend - will introduce you to the fascinating yet grim story of two old friends. To survive and return home, the protagonist must go through all the trials that his friend Jacob has prepared for him.
Features:
Walking simulator genre;
Tense atmosphere;
3D surround sound;
Realistic graphics;
Puzzles:
The game features various types of puzzles, from ordinary item searches and film references to logic tests.

게임 정보
A SPACE ADVENTURE

Anny K. and her robot Droid 07 were kidnapped and locked in different rooms inside a ship controlled by DreX Androids. What they don't know is that anyone has a device to control the Droid 07 remotely and can recognize it to escape back to their planet. In this adventure, help Droid 07 to overcome challenges, discover mysteries and free your friend from the miniaigas.

A PUZZLE GAME FULL OF CHALLENGES

• The game has a progression system for the character
main Droid 07 that unlocks new abilities as the
player advances through levels;
• More than 40 levels in 4 different worlds;
• Coin system that, when collected, unlock phases
bonus;
• 2 playable characters;
• Great sound effects, exciting story and music tracks
exciting to keep the player fully immersed in the Game;
• Beautiful retro graphics in pixel art style, rescuing a nostalgia for
old games

게임 정보


In each level, you must locate and synchronize a constellation, using the instruments and information offered by the software. Use the data and tools in your advantage, explore and gather information for the database.
resources
Identify and synchronize more than 40 constellations;
Atmospheric soundtrack and SFX to help you immerse in the game;
Beautiful technological space art;

게임 정보


Organize by rotating ink-filled stamps to form beautiful shapes,
When completing the puzzle the stamp is pressed on the paper, printing your watercolor painting!

Features:
30 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack composed especially to help you relax;
Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;
Beautiful hand-drawn watercolor art.

게임 정보

Clock Overwhelmed is a game that brings criticism to modern times, in which you have more and more tasks to do and you have to solve a real puzzle to try to fit all your activities.

Shoot all tasks in the blank spaces of your watch,
without overlapping any activity!
Features:
30 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack composed especially to help you stay immersed in the game;
Addictive gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual action games;
Beautiful Lowpoly art style.

게임 정보
Use the rules of the famous Tower of Hanoi puzzle,
where a larger piece cannot be on top of a smaller one.

Every move the piece Spins clockwise changing its pattern,
in most of the cases you have to do one or more extra moves to get the right pattern when stacking.
Features:
50 carefully designed levels;
Original soundtrack inspired by Synthwave classics and some cyberpunk touches;
Relaxing gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual puzzle;
Beautiful futuristic art.

게임 정보
In the game, players will face various challenges and obstacles, and need to solve puzzles, explore and fight to continuously improve their spiritual cultivation. Players can communicate with other living beings, learn the wisdom of ancient immortal cultivation legends and explore the mysteries of ascension. At the same time, players can also collect elixirs, spirit stones and other treasures in the game to enhance their abilities and cultivation in order to better pursue the path of ascension.

1、Open world with multiple floating islands;
2、Multiplayer co-op (10-30 players) , you can explore alone or adventure and fight with your buddies;
3, Ground combat as well as air fights, etc. You can also build your own territory on land;
